    <title lang="en">The Gamekeepers of Mossy Oak</title>
    <sub-title lang="en">GK Podcast #392 - Are Your Mallards Wild?</sub-title>
    <desc lang="en">Once again joined by Dr. Phil Lavretsky of UTEP to update us on the very important Duck DNA project; as you might recall Phil has dedicated the last five years to understanding the game farm mallards' genes that have been present in the Atlantic Flyway but are now starting to pop up elsewhere; it's a duck hunters podcast that needs to be shared with all waterfowlers.</desc>
