    <title lang="fr">Isetenkheb, vie, mort, renaissance</title>
    <desc lang="fr">Follow from the amazing restoration process of one of the most cherished and mysterious pieces of History: an Egyptian sarcophagus covered with hieroglyphics (painted wood). With exclusive interviews of experts, art curators and restorators, discover everything about the story of the Isetenkheb coffin of Ancient Egypt dated from around 664-500 BC !</desc>
    <category lang="fr">Documentaire</category>
    <icon src="http://static-cdn.tv.sfr.net/data/img/pl/3/6/2/15681263.jpg" />
