<programme channel="DocuBox.HD.fr" start="20261021060000 +0000" stop="20261021062500 +0000">
    <title lang="fr">Travel Thru History</title>
    <sub-title lang="fr">Las Vegas</sub-title>
    <desc lang="fr">In this episode we explore Las Vegas' lesser known past. We visit the National Atomic Testing museum to learn about how the desert outside of Vegas was used for testing America's secret nuclear weapons. We also visit the Mormon Fort, the first permanent non-native settlement in the area, as well as the Neon Museum.</desc>
    <category lang="fr">Documentaire de société</category>
    <icon src="http://static-cdn.tv.sfr.net/data/img/pl/2/7/4/15270472.jpg" />
    <episode-num system="onscreen">S1 E2</episode-num>
